github.com/robfig/cron/v3 v3.0.1 parses BurnInSchedule cron expressions. Its
LICENSE file is MIT ("Copyright (C) 2012 Rob Figueiredo ... MIT LICENSE"), it is
not dual-licensed, and it has no dependencies of its own, so it adds nothing
