Runner images are built multi-stage so the NVIDIA CUDA toolchain is used at build
time only. Published runner images contain this project's Apache-2.0 binaries on a
distroless base and no NVIDIA-licensed redistributable libraries; the driver
library (libcuda.so.1) is injected at runtime from the host by the NVIDIA
Container Toolkit.

No component of this project is licensed under a copyleft license (GPL/AGPL/
LGPL/SSPL/MPL). The operator is standalone and does not import the Glimmer
control plane; integration is via the BurnInSink export contract only.
